#: ../../source/index.md:1 85e31a3d4cb74753a36c0476dfe2f672
msgid "Harnessing AI: The Craft of Shaping Agents"
msgstr "驾驭工程：给 AI 套上缰绳"

#: ../../source/index.md:3 95b7a67e024b4b618d07cee805ce507a
msgid ""
"*A long-form, bilingual book about **Harness Engineering** — the deliberate "
"practice of shaping the environment in which AI coding agents operate so the"
" software they produce is verifiable, observable, and understandable.*"
msgstr ""
"*一本关于 **挽具工程** 的长篇、双语之作 —— 一种刻意塑造 AI 编码智能体所处环境的实践，好让它们生产出来的软件是可验证、可观测、可理解的。*"

